OL,3,AProminent Zimbabwean preacher arrested 
OL,4,Aon sexual assault allegations          
OL,6,FA well-known Zimbabwean preacher has   
OL,7,Fbeen arrested on indecent assault and  
OL,8,Fsodomy allegations, local police said. 
OL,10,FUebert Angel, who leads an             
OL,11,Finternational charismatic church with  
OL,12,Fbranches around the world, was arrested
OL,13,Fduring a church service in Harare on   
OL,14,FSunday. Pictures and footage of the    
OL,15,Fdramatic arrest have since been        
OL,16,Fcirculated online.                     
OL,18,FIn one video, a convoy of vehicles is  
OL,19,Fseen escorting the self-styled prophet 
OL,20,Fas he sits in the back of a police van 
OL,21,Fsurrounded by armed police officers.   
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
