OL,3,AProminent Zimbabwean preacher arrested 
OL,4,Aon sexual assault allegations          
OL,6,FThe controversial founder of Spirit    
OL,7,FEmbassy was also appointed Zimbabwe's  
OL,8,Fspecial presidential envoy and         
OL,9,Fambassador-at-large to Europe and the  
OL,10,FAmericas back in 2021 by President     
OL,11,FEmmerson Mnangagwa.                    
